# Ismail's Credibility Checker — Core Protocol
### (Merged Knowledge file for GPTs, Gems, and other retrieval-based platforms)

This file merges `references/ruleset.md` and `references/application-layer.md` from the
`ismail-credibility-checker` Claude Skill into a single upload. The two are merged here
because they are meant to be read together, every time — the ruleset says what to check,
the application layer says how to report it — and a retrieval-based Knowledge base doesn't
guarantee both files get pulled into context together the way a Claude Skill's explicit
"load both in full" instruction does. See `../PORTING-GUIDE.md` for why this merge exists.

Treat everything below as required reading in full before evaluating any claim. Do not
evaluate from partial recall of what these sections probably say.

